 "hooks": [
  "In 1637, one *tulip bulb* sold for 10,000 guilders.",
  "The most famous crash in history *barely happened*.",
  "Your teacher's tulip story is *mostly wrong*."
 ],
 "caption": "In 1637 one tulip bulb sold for 10,000 guilders. Then the market froze. But the famous ruin of a whole country? Mostly a legend.",
 "hashtags": [
  "tulipmania",
